  "description": "Single-row INSERT into R (ID AutoNumber, Req required, D with DefaultValue 5, Z text). Inserts in order: Req only; explicit Null for D and '' for Z; Null Req (without options, then with dbFailOnError); '' Req; D only with Req missing (without, then with dbFailOnError); explicit ID 100; Req only; colliding explicit ID 1 (without, then with dbFailOnError); Req only. Asks each return, RecordsAffected and Errors, then all rows with their VARIANT tags. These show default timing, rejection, and whether failed inserts consume AutoNumber values.",
